<span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li></ul>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How BIM Coordination <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Federation setup</h3><p>Discipline models aligned on shared coordinates and federated, with clash rules and tolerances agreed.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Clash cycles</h3><p>Clash tests run, grouped and assigned to an owner, then re-run on every new model version.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Close-out</h3><p>Resolved issues verified in the latest federated model and the log closed with evidence.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Insights</p><h2 class=\"h2\">BIM Coordination, <em>explained.</em></h2><a class=\"btn dark\" style=\"margin-top:34px\" href=\"/insights/\">All insights <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/insights/technical-guides/reduce-bim-coordination-rework/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>How to Reduce BIM Coordination Rework</b><span>Nov 2026</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/insights/bim-technology/revit-skills-bim-architect/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Revit Skills Every BIM Architect Should Know</b><span>Oct 2026</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/insights/technical-guides/bim-engineer-technical-assessment/\" style=